  "gaps": [
    "Catalog year/term is not stated on the page.",
    "Specific general education courses or clusters making up the 37 Integrative General Education credits are not listed.",
    "The page lists major elective options (BSIT 499 Certification Component, CIS 436 Ethics for IT Professionals, CIS 456 Service Component, CIS 338 Linux 1, CIS 339 Linux 2; 3 credits each) but does not state how many must be taken or whether they count toward the 54 elective credits.",
    "The overview says every IT major completes a faculty-approved IT project, research study, certification or internship (matching CIS 456 Service Component / BSIT 499), but the course listing places these under electives; whether one is a required capstone is not stated.",
    "Kirkpatrick Signature Series is required 'in addition to the major requirements', but its courses and credit hours are not given on this page.",
    "No residency (must-complete-at-Bellevue) requirements, minimum grade, or GPA requirements are stated; the page refers students to an admissions counselor and BRUIN 'Academic Progress' for curriculum requirements."
